  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-12-07T14:54:41.098Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A small addition that would allow you to see what is currently queued to download, avatars, worlds, youtube videos. It would also allow for you to cancel some of these downloads, for example, if an avatar as a BIG download or a world without you knowing until it starts, you could hide the avatar, and then cancel the download. Fixes the issue of having to relaunch to stop an in-progress download.",
